---
import Section from '../Section.astro';
import SectionHeading from '../SectionHeading.astro';
import ServiceRow from '../ServiceRow.astro';
import { SERVICES } from '../../data/services';
---

<Section id="services" class="bg-navy py-24 text-pearl md:py-32 lg:py-40">
  <SectionHeading number="02" tone="dark">
    Every layer of the property, held to one standard.
  </SectionHeading>

  <div class="mt-10 flex justify-start gap-x-6">
    <p class="col-span-12 max-w-xl text-[0.9375rem] leading-relaxed text-pearl/65 md:col-span-7 md:col-start-4" data-reveal>
      My work is management, in the full sense of the word. I oversee the day-to-day life of the property,
      coordinate and supervise the trades, manage budgets and vendor relationships, and keep the systems —
      water, solar, power, grounds, equipment — functioning quietly in the background. I understand this work
      from the ground up, moving easily between the details and the big picture, protecting both the property
      and the investment it represents. Sometimes the work is technical. Sometimes it is logistical. Often,
      it is leadership.
    </p>
  </div>

  <div class="mt-14 border-b border-pearl/15 lg:mt-20" data-reveal-group>
    {SERVICES.map((s) => (
      <ServiceRow
        number={s.number}
        title={s.title}
        description={s.summary}
        href={`/services/${s.slug}/`}
        tone="dark"
      />
    ))}
  </div>

  <p class="mt-14 max-w-xl font-serif text-lg font-light italic leading-relaxed text-gold-light" data-reveal>
    One steward. One point of contact. Every responsibility handled.
  </p>
</Section>
